      "text": "[5:00PM] #MobolajiBankAnthonyWay #TrafficUpdate \n\nVehicular movement remains smooth on the service lane at Anthony, both inbound and outbound, through the Maryland intersection toward Odo-Iyalaro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way.\n\nTraffic is also flowing well across Oba Akran Road, Kodesoh Road, Local Airport Road, Oba Akinjobi Way, and within Ikeja GRA, including both directions of Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way.\n\nThe Oba Akran Link Bridge and Airport Link Road are currently clear and moving freely.\n\nOur officers are actively managing key choke points to maintain the smooth flow of vehicles.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
