      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/WithFaithDaily/status/1949507722161905735",
      "text": "The ULTIMATE Guide to the World’s Largest & Most Notable Islands by Region! ✨🌊\nFrom tropical paradises to icy wildernesses — explore Earth’s most iconic islands! 🌏👇\n📍 OCEANIA / PACIFIC\n• New Guinea – Wild, diverse & shared by two nations\n• Borneo – Home to orangutans & ancient rainforests\n• Hawaii (Big Island) – Volcanoes & aloha spirit!\n• New Zealand: North & South Islands – LOTR vibes!\n• Plus: Fiji’s Viti Levu, Samoa’s Savai’i, French Polynesia’s Bora Bora 💙\n\n📍 ASIA\n• Sumatra & Java – Powerhouses of biodiversity\n• Luzon & Mindanao – Heart of the Philippines\n• Japan’s Big 4: Honshu, Hokkaido, Kyushu, Shikoku\n• Hainan & Taiwan (disputed)\n• Socotra – Alien dragon’s blood trees! 🌵\n📍 EUROPE\n• Iceland – Fire & ice wonderland\n• Great Britain & Ireland – Celtic legends\n• Mediterranean Gems: Sicily, Sardinia, Corsica, Crete, Rhodes, Corfu\n• Baltic/North: Gotland, Zealand, Mallorca, Ibiza, Menorca\n📍 NORTH AMERICA\n• Baffin Island – Canada’s Arctic giant\n• Long Island & Isle Royale – Wild USA\n• Caribbean: Cuba, Hispaniola (Haiti/DR), Jamaica, Bahamas, Barbados\n📍 SOUTH AMERICA\n• Tierra del Fuego – “End of the World” (Chile/Argentina)\n• Marajó Island – Amazon Delta, Brazil\n• Optional add: Galápagos (Ecuador) for notability\n📍 AFRICA\n• Madagascar – Lemurs & unique wilderness!\n• Zanzibar, Pemba, Mafia – Swahili spice islands\n• Bioko, São Tomé and Príncipe – Atlantic gems\n📍 ARCTIC & SUBARCTIC\n• Greenland – World’s largest island (2.16M km²!)\n• Canada: Devon, Ellesmere, Victoria Islands\n• Russia: Novaya Zemlya, Franz Josef Land\n• Svalbard – Polar bears & North Pole gateway! 🐻‍❄️\n\n📍 ANTARCTIC\n• Alexander Island – Antarctica’s giant\n• South Georgia – King penguin kingdom\n• Kerguelen, Heard & McDonald Islands – Windswept wonders\n📌 Fun Facts:\n✅ Greenland = largest island (not continent)!\n⚠️ Some islands are disputed territories.\n💬 Which island is on your bucket list? Drop a 🌴 or 🏔️!\n🔁 Share if you love island adventures!\n👉 Follow for daily geography gems!",
