      "text": "[6:34PM] #Ojo #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic from Agbara Customs Checkpoint to Iyana Era is flowing steadily.\nMovement from Iyana Era to Afromedia is smooth, and traffic from Afromedia through Iyana Iba toward Volks is even better. Both the Iyana Iba flyover heading toward Mile 2 and the underpass route heading toward Igando are moving well.\nVolks to Barracks is seamless, while Barracks through Abule Osun, Trade Fair, and down to Abule Ado is progressing as expected. No disruptions reported, and traffic officers are actively managing the flow to maintain order on the roads.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
